63608?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=94cd7e3ecd2fedbc070ff227c89b2dec 2x, https://si.imgix.net/90dbc7c9/uploads/origins/e617816d-bd14-48b7-888a-a1d1f3163608?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a6f44607502c7973f0c9c2fa2d212393 3x"}, "body": "前回描いていただいたイラストが本当に素敵で、とても気に入っております。\nこの度は、再びリクエストさせていただきました。\n\nあなたの描かれる恐竜がとても可愛らしく魅力的で、ぜひもう一度お願いしたいと思いました。\n\n今回は、私の創作キャラクター「いちご」を恐竜化したイラストをお願いできましたら幸いです。\n\n完成したイラストは、個人での鑑賞およびSNSヘッダー等に使用予定です。\n\n前回本当に嬉しかったため、再びお願いさせていただきました。\nご検討いただけますと幸いです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17-syk5OECl1-hxe1OWYSFT7pXQtY9kq7", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Pangaea_Pafu/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3584459, "client_id": 173, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc655da2/uploads/origins/2200bfc8-6148-4635-ad37-b196b23bb9fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd6d1db0f71a65ea7b0c48a62d0275a0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cc655da2/uploads/origins/2200bfc8-6148-4635-ad37-b196b23bb9fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd6d1db0f71a65ea7b0c48a62d0275a0, https://si.imgix.net/cc655da2/uploads/origins/2200bfc8-6148-4635-ad37-b196b23bb9fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c49057c0348b984c313bd29dd55c9060 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cc655da2/uploads/origins/2200bfc8-6148-4635-ad37-b196b23bb9fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9cf66ed1b75078ab0ae9f22ac7dab73 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc655da2/uploads/origins/2200bfc8-6148-4635-ad37-b196b23bb9fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=798eb006aaa572def9b09aa86f612806", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cc655da2/uploads/origins/2200bfc8-6148-4635-ad37-b196b23bb9fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=798eb006aaa572def9b09aa86f612806, https://si.imgix.net/cc655da2/uploads/origins/2200bfc8-6148-4635-ad37-b196b23bb9fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=817bcfdc7cf5c58a10589c9bfd348f64 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cc655da2/uploads/origins/2200bfc8-6148-4635-ad37-b196b23bb9fd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff007e2a801a54cd9f100728645f8abf 3x"}, "body": "HELLO!!! Nice to meet you!\nI ABSOLUTELY LOVE YOUR ART SO MUCH!!💓🦖\nPaleontology and dinosaurs are one of my biggest passions. So seeing all of your amazing and precious Dinosaur art puts the biggest smile on my face!\nYou are such an amazing artist!\nI have a character I would love to see in your style!\n\nPlease draw my OC! \nName: ツチノ.\n\nA tiny kaiju girl!\nObsessed with tokusatsu kaiju, sentai, and dinosaurs! She is from the Showa era, so most of her toy collection are vintage.\nShe travels across Japan searching for Yokai and Tsuchinoko.\nIt's her dream to fill a sketchbook with art of every monster that exists!\nShe is always drawing cute pictures of monsters and dinosaurs! She also collects Dinosaur and Kaiju toys.\nVery fun, cheery, adventurous personality! \nNaive innocence. She's not afraid of anything! Wants to be everyone's friend.\n\nPink hair in pigtails.\nVery short, under the size of an average human.\nShe often wears a dress resembling a 科学特捜隊 officer from ウルトラマン.\n\nPlease draw her any way you want!\nPose, scenario, everything I leave to your choice!!!\nCreative freedom!\n\nThank you so much, I hope you will consider!🥳\nYou are awesome! 🦖🦕\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TPK_JW336ksxY3lQM4oQ09LPqDyea6mc?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "tr